# Optimize clear and adjacent transfer loops in validated Android images
# Input is at most ten filtered commands then zero then a complete native image
# Records have sixteen cells and local scratch never reaches the next source cell
# Cell fifteen rewinds the fixed slot walker and cell fourteen carries its count
# Nonzero transfer sources check bounds before destination access
# The original pointer slot provides the unchanged exit two trap
# Convert the interpreter program header to null for a static position independent image
